        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-18047",
        ":question/problem": "Let $a=⟨5,9⟩.$ Find $|\\,a\\,|.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the formula, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\,| & =\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(5)^{2}+(9)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25+81} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{106}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
