        ":question/id": "f0caf898-ce5d-5506-b145-31d60aeb15df",
        ":question/problem": "If $v = ⟨16,-4⟩$, then what is the magnitude of $v$?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question.",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mid v \\mid &= \\sqrt{v_{x}^{2} + v_{y}^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{(16)^{2} + (-4)^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{256 + 16} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{272} \\\\\n&= 4 \\sqrt{17}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
